      "name": "@hui-xu-ai/dsh-wensu",
      "title": {
        "en": "Wensu · CNKI and Web of Science search",
        "zh": "文溯 · 知网与 Web of Science 检索"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Read-only bibliographic search over CNKI and Web of Science, exposed to the agent as MCP tools (search, detail, export, status). The WoS channel carries journal impact factors; filtering and sorting run locally without extra requests. Run `wensu setup` and load the companion extension once.",
        "zh": "只读的文献题录检索（知网 + Web of Science 双渠道），以 MCP 工具接入 agent：search / detail / export / status。WoS 渠道自带期刊影响因子，筛选与排序在本地完成、零额外请求。装完运行 wensu setup，并在浏览器里加载一次配套扩展。"
      },
